      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::web::012::strategy_to_optimize_refractory_alloy_st"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vanadium has a density of approximately 6.11 g/cm³.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to replace 20–30% of the Ta atoms with V while otherwise retaining the HfMoTaTiZr composition.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.design",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
