      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::web::012::strategy_to_optimize_refractory_alloy_st"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Atomic-size and modulus mismatch can produce solid-solution strengthening in refractory high-entropy alloys.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::web::012::strategy_to_optimize_refractory_alloy_st"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Maintained lattice distortion and solid-solution strengthening will preserve the V-substituted alloy's high strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::web::012::strategy_to_optimize_refractory_alloy_st",
        "PMC8746096::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-substituted alloy will preserve ductility as well as strength.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8746096::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yield strength and ductility in the V-substituted alloy should each decline by no more than 10% relative to the baseline.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The density and mechanical-property benefits will persist from room temperature to approximately 1000 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::web::012::strategy_to_optimize_refractory_alloy_st"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The V-substituted alloy will retain its performance under both quasi-static and dynamic loading.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis applies only while the V content remains below its solubility limit in the BCC phase.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "V substitution may cause high-temperature segregation or alter high-temperature phase stability.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Matched baseline and modified alloys will be compared using Archimedes density measurements, X-ray diffraction, and room-temperature and approximately 1000 °C mechanical tests.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.design",
